               </eventList>
               <p xml:id="idm186">King Frederik VII died on 15 November 1863 at Glücksborg Castle in Schleswig-Holstein, but the interment did not take place until 19 December in Roskilde Cathedral. The Funeral March was performed by the Band of the Royal Life Guards outside the cathedral. The funeral cantata was composed by J.P.E. Hartmann. When Gade's march was performed in Frue Kirke (The Church of Our Lady), as mentioned in the score, is unknown.</p>
